that brushing cannot access.\", \"Answer: Water picks help maintain oral health by shooting a strong stream of water at the gum line to eliminate germs and plaque, especially in areas brushing cannot reach. They massage and stimulate soft tissue, reducing the risk of gingivitis, and clean better around teeth and gums by removing food particles.\", \"Answer: A water pick helps keep teeth, gums, mouth, and overall body healthier by shooting a strong stream of water at the gum line to eliminate germs and plaque that are hard to remove with a toothbrush. It massages and stimulates soft tissue to reduce gingivitis risk, cleans better around teeth and gums, and removes food from areas brushing cannot access.\", \"Answer: Water picks help maintain good oral health by shooting a strong stream of water at the gum line to eliminate germs and plaque that are tough to remove with a toothbrush, clean better around teeth and gums, remove food from areas brushing cannot access, massage and stimulate soft tissue to reduce the risk of gingivitis, and contribute to overall healthier teeth, gums, mouth, and body.\", \"Answer: Benefits of a water pick include helping to keep teeth, gums, mouth, and overall body healthier by shooting a strong stream of water at the gum line to eliminate germs and plaque that are tough to remove with a toothbrush; it massages and stimulates soft tissue to reduce the risk of gingivitis; and it cleans better around teeth and gums, removing food from areas brushing cannot access.\"]", "time_sec": 30.715, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 35.0, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 8.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
