 Shugabush Monster from the other island. Then, you must hatch the Shugabush Monsters and buy the breeding structure. Once you have the breeding structure, use the Shugabush and the Furcorn in the Shugabush Island breeding structure to get the Shugabeats monster. Keep in mind that the order of breeding (left or right) does not matter.\", \"Answer: To breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, you need to obtain the Shugabush Monster from the other island, then hatch the Shugabush egg. After that, you must purchase the breeding structure and use the combination of Shugabush and Furcorn in the Shugabush Island breeding structure to breed the Shugabeats. Keep in mind that the order of breeding (left or right) does not matter.\", \"Answer: To breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, you need to obtain the Shugabush Monster from the other island. Then, you need to turn your Shugabush Monsters into an egg, hatch them, buy the breeding structure, and breed them using the combination of Shugabush and Furcorn in the Shugabush Island breeding structure. Keep in mind that the order of breeding does not matter.\"]", "time_sec": 34.963, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 57.58, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
