er from the other island. Then, turn the Shugabush Monster into an egg, hatch it, and buy the breeding structure. Finally, breed the Shugabush and the Furcorn in the Shugabush Island breeding structure to get the Shugabeats Monster.\", \"To breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, obtain a Shugabush Monster from the other island, hatch it, purchase the breeding structure, and then breed it using the Shugabush and the Furcorn on the Shugabush Island breeding structure. Breeding order (left or right) does not matter.\", \"Answer: To breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, you need to obtain a Shugabush Monster from another island, hatch it, buy the breeding structure, and then breed it using the combination of Shugabush and Furcorn on the Shugabush Island breeding structure. Keep in mind that the order of breeding (left or right) does not matter.\"]", "time_sec": 32.086, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 65.62, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
