land breeding structure. Keep in mind that the order of breeding (left or right) does not matter.\", \"Answer: To breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, obtain the Shugabush Monster from the other island, hatch it, buy the breeding structure, and then breed it using the combination of Shugabush and Furcorn in the Shugabush Island breeding structure.\", \"Answer: To breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, you need to obtain a Shugabush Monster from the other island. Then, hatch the Shugabush egg, buy the breeding structure, and breed the Shugabeats using the combination of Shugabush and Furcorn in the Shugabush Island breeding structure. Breeding order (left or right) does not matter.\", \"Answer: To breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, you need to obtain a Shugabush Monster from the other island. Then, turn your Shugabush Monsters into an egg, hatch them, buy the breeding structure, and breed them using the combination of Shugabush and Furcorn in the Shugabush Island breeding structure. Breeding the monsters left or right does not matter.\", \"To breed a Shugabeats in My Singing Monsters, you need to obtain the Shugabush Monster from the other island. Then, you must hatch the Shugabush Monster and purchase the breeding structure. Once you have the breeding structure, you can breed the Shugabeats by using the Shugabush and the Furcorn in the Shugabush Island breeding structure. Keep in mind that the order of breeding (left or right) does not matter.\"]", "time_sec": 34.177, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 60.38, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 7.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
