nd increasing range of motion and flexibility, and offering mental benefits such as decreasing anxiety and depression.\", \"Answer: Cupping massage benefits include eliminating toxins from the body, improving circulation, providing pain relief by reducing tissue inflammation (which can increase range of motion, improve flexibility, and control pain), and offering mental benefits such as decreasing anxiety and depression.\", \"Answer: Some of the cupping massage benefits include eliminating toxins from the body, improving circulation, providing pain relief by reducing inflammation of tissues (which can increase range of motion, improve flexibility, and control pain), and offering mental benefits such as decreasing anxiety and depression.\"]", "time_sec": 20.299, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 54.05, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
