age high temperature in Tallahassee, Florida is 79 degrees Fahrenheit, and the average low temperature is 56 degrees Fahrenheit. Freezing temperatures occur sporadically from November to March, with two or three nights on average dropping to 20 °F (-8 °C) or lower. There is also a rare event where the temperature never rises above 32 °F, which typically occurs just once a decade.\", \"Answer: Based on the given passages, Tallahassee, Florida has an overall average high temperature of 79 degrees and an average low of 56 degrees. Freezing temperatures occur sporadically from November to March, with two or three nights on average dropping to 20 °F (-8 °C) or lower. The city can also experience a day when the temperature never rises above 32 °F, though this is rare, happening just once a decade.\"]", "time_sec": 34.057, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 75.76, "GAVIE-Rel": 10.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.9, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
