age 3).  \\n\\nThe passages do not mention any side effects of drinking clove tea.  \\n\\nAnswer: Benefits include stress relief, digestive aid, and pain relief; side effects are not mentioned in the given passages.\", \"Answer: Benefits of drinking clove tea include soothing the senses, relieving stress, providing relief from stress when mixed with basil, mint, cardamom, and honey, aiding digestion by stimulating blood flow, saliva production, and gastric secretions, and relieving abdominal pain and gas pain due to its analgesic qualities. Side effects are not mentioned in the given passages.\"]", "time_sec": 45.763, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 41.03, "GAVIE-Rel": 9.5, "GAVIE-Acc": 9.5, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
