{"id": "683", "question": "how to get free voip service and phone number", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, here are some ways to get free VoIP service and phone numbers:\n\n1. Free DID (incoming numbers) from around the world: There are several companies offering free or paid VoIP services that provide incoming numbers from around the world. These numbers can be obtained by signing up for a VoIP service provider and paying a flat yearly rate or monthly fee.\n2. Get a free Virtual Phone Number (VOIP) from Google: According to the passage, Google offers free virtual phone numbers that can be used to place and receive calls using the internet. To get a free number, visit the author's YouTube channel and follow the instructions provided.\n3. Cloud VoIP Service: The passage mentions a cloud VoIP service that provides toll-free numbers and US local numbers that can be forwarded to any US number (including cell phones) or used with a SIP device. While there is no direct mention of free service, the passage does indicate that the pricing has been lowered.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages. None of the passages provide detailed information on how to get free VoIP service and phone numbers without any additional costs or requirements.", "pred": "To get a free VoIP service and phone number, you can visit the YouTube channel at http://www.youtube.com/user/ricsil2037, which provides a video showing how to obtain a free Virtual Phone Number (VOIP) from Google.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_sc_nemotron", "raw_output": "Answer: To get a free VoIP service and phone number, you can visit the YouTube channel at http://www.youtube.com/user/ricsil2037, which provides a video showing how to obtain a free Virtual Phone Number (VOIP) from Google.", "cot": "[\"Answer: To get a free VoIP service and phone number, you can visit the YouTube channel at http://www.youtube.com/user/ricsil2037, which provides a video showing how to obtain a free Virtual Phone Number (VOIP) from Google.\", \"Answer: You can get free VoIP service and a phone number by using Google's free Virtual Phone Number (VOIP) service, which can be accessed through the YouTube channel at http://www.youtube.com/user/ricsil2037, as mentioned in passage 2.\", \"Answer: To get free VoIP service and a phone number, visit the YouTube channel at http://www.youtube.com/user/ricsil2037, where a video demonstrates obtaining a free Virtual Phone Number (VOIP) from Google, a respected company.\", \"Answer: To get free VoIP service and a phone number, you can visit the YouTube channel at http://www.youtube.com/user/ricsil2037, where a video demonstrates how to obtain a free Virtual Phone Number (VOIP) from Google. Additionally, some companies offer free DID (incoming) numbers from around the world, which can be used to receive calls on a PSTN or mobile phone.\", \"Answer: To get free VoIP service and a phone number, you can visit the YouTube channel at http://www.youtube.com/user/ricsil2037, which provides a video tutorial on obtaining a free Virtual Phone Number (VOIP) from Google.\"]", "time_sec": 25.879, "nemotron": {"runtime": "transformers-trust-remote-code", "method": "sc", "num_rollout": 5, "temperature": 0.7, "top_p": 0.9, "enable_thinking": false, "media": {"video": false, "audio": false, "image": false}}, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 22.62, "GAVIE-Rel": 8.0, "GAVIE-Acc": 5.0, "Status": "success", "GAVIE-Judge": "glm-4.5-flash"}}
